$$
E = \frac{1}{2} \times 17.9 \times (25.6)^2 = \frac{1}{2} \times 17.9 \times 655.36 = 8.95 \times 655.36 = 5867.31 \, \text{J}
$$

Resultado final:  
{"value": 5867.31, "unit": "J"}

